<title>USA: Oswego, Ill., won by Nike Securities.</title>
<headline>Oswego, Ill., won by Nike Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nike Securities LP said it won $4.400 million of Oswego, Ill., general obligation bonds, Series 1997B, with a net interest cost of 5.011 percent.</p>
</text>
